ameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container align-center\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-white col-md-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                    <br>Terje Grønning</h1>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-light pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\">\n                    Beautiful mobile websites\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                    Welcome to my home page. The collections of&nbsp; photos pertain to&nbsp; townscapes, buildings and public baths in Japan, as well as folk art/crafts in Japan, Norway and Sweden.&nbsp;All photos are unless otherwise noted my own. All images copyrighted. </p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white-outline\" href=\"page230.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Townscapes in&nbsp; North Japan</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white-outline\" href=\"page53.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Townscapes in Central Japan</a>    <a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://terjegro.github.io/west/page231.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Townscapes in West&nbsp; Japan</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://terjegro.github.io/west/page156.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Townscapes in&nbsp; South&nbsp; Japan</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://terjegro.github.io/folk/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Typ